#: snippetrepository.cpp:219
msgid ""
"You have edited a data file not located in your personal data directory; as "
"such, a renamed clone of the original data file has been created within your "
"personal data directory."
msgstr ""
"Du hest en Datendatei bewerkt, de nich binnen Dien persöönlich Datenorner "
"liggt. Dorwegen wöör vun de Orginaaldatei binnen Dien persöönlich Datenorner "
"en Kloonkopie mit den sülven Naam opstellt."

